
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Oops! Something Went Wrong</title>

  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:wght@400;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;
      background: #dff3ff;
      color: #37334d;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 24px;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      position: relative;
    }

    /* Floating background decorations */
    body::before,
    body::after {
      content: "";
      position: fixed;
      border-radius: 50%;
      z-index: -1;
      opacity: 0.7;
    }

    body::before {
      width: 300px;
      height: 300px;
      background: #ffd9e7;
      top: -100px;
      left: -100px;
    }

    body::after {
      width: 250px;
      height: 250px;
      background: #fff0b8;
      bottom: -80px;
      right: -60px;
    }

    .error-card {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 750px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88);
      border: 3px solid #fff;
      border-radius: 32px;
      padding: 48px 28px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 0 #c4e2f4,
                  0 22px 50px rgba(75, 105, 145, 0.15);
      animation: pop-in 0.6s ease both;
    }

    .mascot {
      font-size: 76px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      display: inline-block;
      animation: wobble 3s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    .error-code {
      font-size: clamp(76px, 15vw, 120px);
      font-weight: 900;
      line-height: 1;
      letter-spacing: -5px;
      color: #8274d9;
      text-shadow: 5px 5px 0 #e5dcff;
    }

    .error-title {
      font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 40px);
      font-weight: 900;
      margin: 18px 0 12px;
    }

    .error-message {
      display: inline-block;
      max-width: 100%;
      padding: 12px 20px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      background: #fff0c9;
      border: 2px dashed #f2c56c;
      color: #73552c;
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 800;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    .description {
      max-width: 460px;
      margin: 18px auto 28px;
      color: #77758e;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .home-btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 14px 28px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: #ffcf70;
      color: #493d4f;
      border: 3px solid #493d4f;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 0 #493d4f;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 17px;
      font-weight: 900;
      transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
    }

    .home-btn:hover {
      transform: translateY(3px);
      box-shadow: 0 2px 0 #493d4f;
    }

    .home-btn:active {
      transform: translateY(5px);
      box-shadow: none;
    }

    .tiny-note {
      margin-top: 26px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #a1a0b5;
    }

    @keyframes pop-in {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(20px) scale(0.96);
      }
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0) scale(1);
      }
    }

    @keyframes wobble {
      0%, 100% { transform: rotate(-5deg); }
      50% { transform: rotate(5deg); }
    }

    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      .error-card {
        padding: 35px 18px;
        border-radius: 24px;
      }

      .mascot {
        font-size: 60px;
      }

      .error-message {
        font-size: 16px;
      }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *, *::before, *::after {
        animation: none !important;
        transition: none !important;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <main class="error-card">

    <div class="mascot" aria-hidden="true">🥺</div>

    <h1 class="error-code"><%= statusCode %></h1>

    <h2 class="error-title">Oops! Something went wrong!</h2>

    <p class="error-message"><%= message %></p>

    <p class="description">
      Looks like our little adventure took an unexpected turn.
      Don't worry, let's get you back on track! ✨
    </p>

    <a href="/listings" class="home-btn">🏠 Take Me Home</a>

    <p class="tiny-note">
      Made with a little magic and a lot of ☁️
    </p>

  </main>
</body>
</html>
